; ＠ト書き▼議論10-5【蓮見レイア】
; 議論開始カットイン
; BGM変更：HirO（Voなし）
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_37_1_Loop IntroBgmPath:Bgm_37_1_Intro Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

; ボス演出
@ResetText
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0 Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.2
@ModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:1 Height:5.6 Rotation:"0,{ (8 / courtStandCount * 360)},0" Distance:12 Duration:0
@WaitForNextFrame

@ModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:1 Rotation:"0,{ (8.1 / courtStandCount * 360)},0" Duration:1 EaseName:OutQuad
@ShowPerspectiveStageScreen Index:1
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

@ResetText
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0 Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR8,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Fearful_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@ModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 Height:5.6 Rotation:"0,{ (3 / courtStandCount * 360)},0" Distance:12 Duration:0
@WaitForNextFrame

@ModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 Rotation:"0,{ (2.9 / courtStandCount * 360)},0" Duration:1 EaseName:OutQuad
@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

# Judge10-5-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:君は人に見られる為に<br>活動を続けていた……。|#0205Trial05_Hiro001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.8
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:どんな手段を使ってでも、<br>常に自分が一番でないと<br>気が済まなかったんだ。|#0205Trial05_Hiro002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR9,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Fearful_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ち、違う！<br>私は、そんなこと……！|#0205Trial05_Leia001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.10
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:何が違うのかな。|#0205Trial05_Hiro003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.11
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:それとも君は、<br>魔法の使用を否定するのかい？|#0205Trial05_Hiro004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR1,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Downcast_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そ、それは……。|#0205Trial05_Leia002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

